#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:1
msgid "Build with the CUTLASS Compiler"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:3
msgid ""
"CuTe kernels compile through NVIDIA's CUTLASS 4.7 compiler library, not "
"through the native LLVM path. `cargo oxide` installs the pinned release "
"once, checks its digest on every load, and embeds the resulting cubin in "
"your binary."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:7
msgid ""
"Rust kernel\n"
"  ──►  one Pliron module: dialect-cute, dialect-mir, dialect-nvvm\n"
"  ──►  whole-module verification and the target gate\n"
"  ──►  CUTLASS MLIR text\n"
"  ──►  libCutlassCompiler 4.7.0\n"
"  ──►  cubin embedded in the host binary\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:16
msgid "Install once"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:18
msgid "cargo oxide toolchain install cutlass\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:22
msgid ""
"Downloads the CUTLASS 4.7.0 release archive from GitHub and verifies the "
"archive and library SHA-256 digests. The bundle is under the NVIDIA EULA; "
"the installer prints the notice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:25
msgid ""
"Linux x86_64 with CUDA 13 only. The library lands in Cargo's data directory "
"under `cuda-oxide/toolchains/cutlass/4.7.0/x86_64-cu13`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:27
msgid ""
"`CUDA_OXIDE_CUTLASS_COMPILER=/abs/path/libCutlassCompiler.so` overrides "
"discovery. The digest check still applies, so only the byte-identical 4.7.0 "
"library loads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:30
msgid "Build and run"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:32
msgid ""
"CUDA_OXIDE_DEVICE_BACKEND=cutlass-mlir cargo oxide run elementwise_cute --"
"arch sm_120a\n"
"CUDA_OXIDE_DEVICE_BACKEND=cutlass-mlir cargo oxide build "
"fp16_gemm_256x352_cute --arch sm_100a\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:37
msgid ""
"Every CuTe kernel needs `CUDA_OXIDE_DEVICE_BACKEND=cutlass-mlir`. The native "
"backend has no CuTe lowering and stops with a verification error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:39
msgid ""
"Two targets: `sm_100a` and `sm_120a`. Anything else is rejected before "
"compilation and the error names the target. `tcgen05` operations need "
"`sm_100a`; MXF4 register MMA needs `sm_120a`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:42
msgid ""
"`cargo oxide run` without `--arch` uses the detected GPU, so an RTX 5090 "
"gets `sm_120a`. `cargo oxide build` needs `--arch`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:44
msgid ""
"Each example README states its device and shape requirements. The [support "
"matrix](support-matrix.md) lists what the two targets cover."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:47
msgid "Options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:0
msgid "Variable"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:0
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:0
msgid "`CUDA_OXIDE_DEVICE_BACKEND`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:0
msgid "`native` (default) or `cutlass-mlir`; other values fail"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:0
msgid "`CUDA_OXIDE_MLIR_PROFILE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:0
msgid ""
"`cutlass-full-cute-mlir22` (default) or `cutlass-primitives-mlir22` for "
"kernels that use `ctm-rs` alone; part of the build fingerprint"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:0
msgid "`CUDA_OXIDE_CUTLASS_OPT_LEVEL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:0
msgid ""
"`2` or `3` (default); the attention examples compare at `2`; part of the "
"build fingerprint"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:0
msgid "`CUDA_OXIDE_MLIR_OUTPUT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:0
msgid "Path for the prepared MLIR text, for example `$PWD/module.mlir`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:0
msgid "`CUDA_OXIDE_CUTLASS_COMPILER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:0
msgid "Absolute path to a `libCutlassCompiler.so` with the pinned digest"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:57
msgid ""
"`CUDA_OXIDE_BACKEND` selects the rustc backend library, not the device path. "
"Keep MLIR dumps and cubins out of version control."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:60
msgid "Failures"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:62
msgid ""
"Unsupported operations, rejected targets, verification errors and compiler "
"errors stop the build. There is no fallback to another backend."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/build-with-cutlass.md:64
msgid ""
"The compiler checks layouts, operand roles, pipeline state and the launch "
"ABI. It does not prove thread convergence, barrier phases, asynchronous "
"completion or pointer lifetimes; see [Checks and Obligations](contracts.md)."
msgstr ""
